src/cyrusasha_odl/data/rtl-words.txt.gz is data derived from word counts of
Wikipedia articles and the OpenSubtitles frequency lists of
https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords; it is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 license (CC BY-SA 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

test/fixtures/rtl/fa-sample.pdf embeds a subset of the Vazirmatn font
(https://github.com/rastikerdar/vazirmatn), licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1.
